              <td height="2"> 
                <div align="center"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="5" align="center"><b>Netanyahu: 
                  media savvy and corrupt to the core</b></font></div>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr align="left" valign="top"> 
              <td height="15" align="left" valign="top">&nbsp;</td>
            </tr>
            <tr align="left" valign="top"> 
              <td height="81" align="center" valign="middle" width="48%" style="font-size: 0;"><img src="/sites/pmwatch.org/pmw/cast/bibi2.jpg" width="170" height="153"></td>
            </tr>
            <tr align="left" valign="top"> 
              <td height="2"> 
                <hr height="1">
